<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 23, 2003 :: Klandicar dead</div>Thanks all for making a quick Sunday trip out to Western Wastes, and grats Lentor on your talisman! <p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 25, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 22, 2003 :: Help the Dain, Kill the Dain... we can't decide</div><P>Grats Feskan on 65 and Overlord!<BR>Grats Ladibugg on 59!<BR>Grats Morlith and Razillia on 52!<BR>Grats Khyrra on 50!</P>
<P>Colwn's turn was up to get his 10th ring, so we headed down and decimated lots more giants once again. Grats Colwn on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>! Wonderous got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Jenrenee got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Feskan got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A>, Yimish got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Divan got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A> for greed and Jakr got <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A> on greed. </P>
<P>After that, we headed on in to visit the Dain, what with being war buddies and all. Mahrsan and Vorne invited him to a private meeting and we keeled him flawlessly. Grats Ceyria on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16177">Dain's Head</A> (to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/belt_dwarfslaying.JPG">Belt of Dwarf Slaying</A>), Thayet on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/frostreavers_embroidered_cloak.jpg">Frostreaver's Embroidered Cloak</A>, Morlith on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/frostreavers_velium_crown.jpg">Frostreaver's Velium Crown</A>, and Wonderous saved the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6736">Aegis of Ice</A> from rotting. </P>
<P>And I got famous pictures of feet! We know how I love feet.. But, as Myschief said, it's hard to get a good battle shot against a shortie. /nods</P>
<P><IMG alt="WOOT! Feet! Eat that, Nibbs!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainfeet.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 23, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 21, 2003 :: Back to Sleepers</div><P>Grats Yimish on 60 and Warlord!</P>
<P>Well, back on our Friday night run to Sleeper's Tomb. We twinked out Feskan with an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/ancientprismaticspear.jpg">ancient prismatic spear</A> and an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Axe.jpg">ancient prismatic axe!</A> Reide got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/sightlessveliumeye.jpg">Sightless Velium Eye</A> and Lush even got both parts to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Chromatic_Gaunts_of_the_ages.jpg">Chromatic Gauntlets of the Ages</A>. Divan&nbsp;got&nbsp;both parts to make a&nbsp;<A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=20624">Chromatic Veil of the Ages</A> as well. Some Premier rotted, though a pair of <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Premier_Fist_Wraps_of_Secundae.jpg">fistwraps</A> dropped for Jakr, and I think Colwn was pleased with a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/premier_bow_of_secundae.jpg">bow</A>. </P>
<P><IMG alt="The phrase that makes Reide say fuck you!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stmonktrap.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stfinalarb.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>The folks online in Voxxy level ran down and killed Vox before Sleepers. This time was Vahnel, Baxis, Shatta and Dyanna.&nbsp; <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/voxxy.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 9, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 20, 2003 :: Klandicar, Rumblecrush and Doomshade provide fun!</div><P>Saw Klandicar up and waving a talisman for Feskan, so we went and took it from him. Grats Fezz!</P>
<P>Wonderous led us to something a little different tonight, crossing dreaded Maiden's Eye to get to the Umbral Planes where he had spotted Rumblecrush up when looking for alternate targets. Had a flawless victory against Rumble and only one guard add which Sonaddor dispatched during the fight while Arglar (aka DORF) tanked the big guy for us. </P>
<P>Grats Lentor on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/etherealsilksleeves.jpg">Ethereal Silk Sleeves</A> and Bearspirit on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/wickedmail.jpg">Wicked Mail</A>. And thanks to folks for passing down loot and more loot. You guys are great, as always. </P>
<P align=center><IMG alt="Let's get ready to ruuuumble!! (couldn't resist)" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/rumble.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>After that, Vorne ran out and pulled lots of dark masters and various other stuff in his way to spawn Doomshade. Then he did a flawless pull of Doom! Well, flawless if you like fighting Doom with half a dozen adds, most unmezzable. /grins In true Capulan style, it was a brawl, and people took the initiative and killed off the unmezzables, the monkeys were mezzed or charmed, and in the end only two of ours had fallen.. Wonderous at the start before the adds were under control, and Arglar when most was dead and Doom was at 2 %. Very fun and very nice work all! </P>
<P>Grats Cimerene on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Bow_Doom.jpg">Bow of Doom</A> and Leviathaun on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Mithral_Edged_short_Sword.jpg">Mithril Edged Short Sword</A>. A <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/rod_of_virtue.jpg">rod of virtue</A> rotted and Lev also got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/BraceletofQuickness.gif">Bracelet of Quickness</A> to upgrade his Hero Bracer. Everyone point and laugh at his gear... he's even wearing a netted kelp hat! </P>
<P align=center><IMG alt="Above the crowd." hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/nibbler/doom.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P align=center><IMG alt=Corpse! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/doom.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Edit by Nibbler: HAHA!&nbsp; Good thing Doom had no feet for you to take pics of!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 24, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 19, 2003 :: Bug Squished!</div><P>Raihn watched the burrower evolve and we ran down to squish him on Kithik's alert. Grats Kantar on a well deserved <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/talisman_burrower.gif">Talisman of the Burrower</A>, and Kyriath got some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/Strands_of_Power.jpg">Strands of Power</A> as rot loot. Several spells dropped as well. </P>
<P>Little slow, but some leveling grats!</P>
<P>Grats Ckaii on 65 and Lord Protector!!<BR>Grats Edenstar on 54!<BR>Grats Fahrgus on 52!<BR>Grats Leviathaun on 49!<BR><BR>...I know I'm missing a bunch, holler at me in game, and sorry ahead of time!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Dec 9, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 15, 2003 :: Sontalak gives the gnomer a talisman</div><P>Had a lot of folks away, so decided not to run up and see if Yelinak was awake and did Sont quick instead. Messy, but dead. Grats Xman on your talisman!</P>
<P>Bored, so had to try it. Vahnel, Dyanna, Baxis and Shatta killed Nagafen. <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/naggyteam.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 19, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 14, 2003 :: Sleeper's Tomb Revisited</div><P>Headed back into ST and managed to get 6 more Ancient Prismatic weapons. Grats Reide on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Lance.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Lance</A>, Vorne and Colwn on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Axe.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Axes</A>, Kithik on an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/AncientPrismaticBattlehammer.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Battlehammer</A>, Raihndance on an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Stiletto.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Stiletto</A> and Antroe on an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Staff.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Staff</A>! Wonderous also got some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Velium_Fraught_Shackles.jpg">Velium Fraught Shackles</A> and tons of quest crap nobody wanted, lots of premier weapons got looted or rotted, Divan&nbsp;saved one of those <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16078">Furious Shrouds&nbsp;of Unlife</A> from rotting and Mahrsan got a nifty <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/sightlessveliumeye.jpg">Sightless Velium Eye</A>. </P>
<P>We wound our way down to the Final Arbiter, killing all sorts of various mobs that popped as we killed, making Wonder giddy with quest items to fill up the bank. I even took a couple pictures. </P>
<P>Wonderslippers!<BR><IMG alt="Dainty Blue Slippers!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stwondshoes.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Master of the Guard<BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stmotg.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>The Final Arbiter<BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stfinal.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR><IMG alt=Bwahaha! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stks.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Before heading to Sleeper's Tomb, we tried to get a rezz stick for emergencies, but Vox was cheap. Vahnel (51 warrior), Fahrgus (51 paladin), Baxis (51 monk), Dyanna (52 druid) and Shatta (49 cleric) killed Vox with Vaea and Bearspirit (sorta). <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/voxteam.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>And earlier in the day, Dyanna got the seahorse and completed her epic. <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dyannaepic.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 19, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 13, 2003 :: Little pre-dragon Bug Killing</div><P>Thanks to Raihn keeping her vigilant bugwatch, we got to head on down and squash the bug again! Grats Talyss on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/BileCoatedCodex.gif">Bile Coated Codex</A> and Meeka on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/Strands_of_Power.jpg">Strands of Power</A> and Colwn got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=13332">Orb</A>. </P>
<P>Inny wasn't up, so Antroe ran around and found that Klandicar was still up and waiting for us. Grats Jenrenee on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Klandicar_s_Talisman.jpg">talisman</A> and Leviathaun on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/PeerlessDragonhideBreastplate.JPG">new breastplate</A>! </P>
<P>Some leveling grats!<BR>Grats Juhel on 60 and High Priestess!<BR>Grats Yimish on 59!<BR>Grats Garrich on 55 and Animist!<BR>Grats Tristastar on 51 and Vicar!<BR>Grats Khyrra on 46!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 21, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=8'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=7'>7</a> <a href='news.asp?page=8'>8</a> 9 <a href='news.asp?page=10'>10</a> <a href='news.asp?page=11'>11</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=10'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=620><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/manaetic_behemoth.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Mar 26</b></a> - Manetic Behemoth and Cap!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
